      "small_logo_thumb_url": "https://bookface-images.s3.amazonaws.com/small_logos/1facd73d30a20793ef94c43f6742013e75aaf407.png",
      "website": "https://meetluminary.ai/",
      "all_locations": "San Francisco, CA, USA",
      "long_description": "Luminary is an AI CEO that leads human and agent teams on company-wide missions. We're building the complete infrastructure for a fully AI-native company, starting with a world model of how your business works and building up to an AI CEO that can lead it.\r\n\r\nToday's AI tools are good at automating the work they're handed, but they still wait to be told what to do next. So even with the abundance of AI agents, companies are still bottlenecked by leadership and vision. Someone has to decide what's worth building, rally the right people behind it, and bring it to market.\r\n\r\nLuminary takes on that job. Instead of asking it to build a feature, you hand it part of your business to grow. It then proactively discovers opportunities, plans high-impact missions, and leads your people and its own agent swarms to accomplish them. \r\n\r\nSome examples of audacious missions it can execute:\r\n\r\n- Launch a product: It spots customers building the same workaround, makes the business case, directs coding agents to build it, and rolls it out.\r\n- Enter a new market: It finds an unexpected group of buyers, reworks positioning and pricing around them, and wins the first accounts.\r\n- Rescue a stalled deal: It notices an enterprise deal losing momentum, designs a new strategy with your sales team, and gets it signed.\r\n\r\nUnder the hood, Luminary builds a living world model and follows a leadership constitution that shapes every call. Proprietary evals check every deliverable, and a recursive self-improvement loop turns each mission into institutional wisdom.",
      "one_liner": "AI CEO that leads human & agent teams on company-wide missions",
